        "description": "The largest religious monument in the world, with five towers rising above a moat.",
        "details": "Angkor Wat was built in the twelfth century for Suryavarman II and faces west. Sunrise from the causeway is the classic view, though it is crowded, and the galleries of bas-reliefs are quieter later in the morning. Cover shoulders and knees, as the temple is still a place of worship. Tickets are bought in advance at the Angkor ticket centre.",
