        "description": "A walled royal city with the Bayon temple of 200 smiling stone faces.",
        "details": "Angkor Thom was the last great capital of the Khmer empire, entered through a gate lined with giant statues. The Bayon temple has towers carved with smiling faces, and the Terrace of the Elephants and Baphuon are nearby. A tuk-tuk day around the small circuit passes all of them.",
