        "description": "The finely carved pink sandstone temple known as the citadel of women, with further temples on the way.",
        "details": "Banteay Srei is small but has the most delicate carving in Angkor. It lies about 25 kilometres from Siem Reap, and a day trip can include Banteay Samre and Pre Rup temples on the grand circuit. Starting early avoids the heat.",
