        "description": "A boat trip to a stilted village on the great lake, at its best in the wet season.",
        "details": "Floating and stilted villages around Kompong Phluk and Kampong Khleang rise out of the lake, with houses on tall poles in the dry season. A small boat visits flooded forests during the high-water months, from about August to November. Choose a community-run tour and keep any donations responsible.",
