      "cambodia/battambang-countryside": {
        "name": "Battambang bamboo train, bat cave and countryside",
        "description": "A rickety bamboo train, a bat cave at sunset and rural villages around a quiet French-era town.",
        "details": "Battambang has colonial architecture and a young arts scene. The bamboo train is a wooden platform on rails running through fields, now a short tourist ride. Phnom Sampeau offers a cave where bats stream out at dusk, and the Killing Caves memorial. A tuk-tuk loop covers the sights.",
        "interests": [
