        "name": "Central Market and Russian Market",
        "description": "Art Deco halls and busy stalls for crafts, silk and street food.",
        "details": "The Central Market (Psar Thmei) is a domed Art Deco building with jewellery and goods, and the Russian Market (Psar Toul Tom Poung) is better for souvenirs, silk and antiques. Evening at the riverside is a lively time for food and a walk.",
