        "details": "Kep is famous for its crab market, where fresh crab is cooked with Kampot pepper. Boats cross to Rabbit Island in about 20 minutes, with hammocks, simple huts and calm swimming. Kep is about 30 minutes from Kampot and works as a day trip.",
